Build Instructions
==================

To build the project, follow these steps:

- Using kas:

```
kas build kas-meta-foo.yml
kas build kas-meta-foo.yml --target foo-image -c populate_sdk
```

This meta-layer builds an example program which just prints the contents of
X_PROTOCOL inside X11/X.h provided by the xorgproto package.

This will demonstrate that just by adding the xorgproto as a build dependency
of foo-program, will not cause xorgproto-dev to be installed in the SDK.
